---
description: Best practices for Next.js 15 App Router
globs: app/**/*.{ts,tsx}, app/**/*.{ts,tsx}
---

- Default to Server Components for rendering & data fetching
- Use Client Components only for browser interactivity
- Fetch data in Server Components
- Use Server Actions for server-side mutations and logic
- Use `generateStaticParams` for static route pre-generation
- Implement ErrorBoundary for route errors
- Use `notFound()`/`redirect()` for route handling
- Organize routes within `app/` with clear naming
- Use `useSearchParams` & `usePathname` in Client Components
- Prefer Server Components/Actions for API calls	